# Pairs with SeedCovered (review C1: every close re-claims). An abandoned
# attempt's seed still in flight is then admitted after its token closed,
# above the close heads and unreported.
MODULE: SeedCoveredCloseWithoutReclaim
TARGET: SeedCovered
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a close removes the switch's token without re-claiming the routing generation
PERTURBS: Close

--- FIND
    /\ gen' = IF gen < MaxGen THEN gen + 1 ELSE gen
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no re-claim.
    /\ gen' = gen
--- END
